e_call-a094275f-a642-43f0-af46-7d17aba510c8-5","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","status":"completed"},{"id":"tco_2b8ae644-f5ea-92fc-bf77-582eaa3653be_call-a094275f-a642-43f0-af46-7d17aba510c8-6","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","status":"completed"},{"content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"{\n  \"points\": [\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"In 2024, Borobudur recorded approximately 1.3 million visitors, achieving 87% of its 1.5 million target, including 200,000 international tourists; the 2025 target is 1.7 million visitors.\",\n      \"source_name\": \"ANTARA News (citing PT Taman Wisata Candi Borobudur)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.antaranews.com/news/339854/indonesias-borobudur-temple-targets-17-million-visitors-in-2025\",\n      \"date\": \"January 1, 2025\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Access to the Borobudur temple structure is limited to a daily quota of 1,200 visitors.\",\n      \"source_name\": \"Multiple reports citing PT Taman Wisata Candi Borobudur rules (e.g., MDPI Heritage article)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mdpi.com/2571-9408/8/2/77\",\n      \"date\": \"2025\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"fact\": \"Temple structure climb ticket prices (as of 2025): IDR 120,000 for domestic tourists and IDR 455,000 for foreign tourists (grounds-only tickets are IDR 50,000 domestic / IDR 400,000 foreign).\",\n      \"source_name\": \"MDPI Heritage (citing PT Taman Wisata Candi Borobudur, 2025)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.mdpi.com/2571-9408/8/2/77\",\n      \"date\": \"2025\"\n    }\n  ]\n}","logprobs":[],"annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.mdpi.com/2571-9408/8/2/77","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.mdpi.com/2571-9408/8/2/77"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://travel-lush.com/borobudur-temple/","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://travel-lush.com/borobudur-temple/"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_me2wYUfeSg","start_index":0,"end_index":0,"title":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_m